+# Generation prompts
+
+Tool: built-in image_gen. All additional views were edited from view-front.png.
+
+## Front initial
+
+Use case: identity-preserve. Create view-front.png: one full-body FRONT orthographic modeling reference of the man in the provided reference image. Preserve recognizable face, short dark curly hair, dense short beard, tan skin and massive heavyweight powerlifter build, age about 35, 180cm 120kg, thick neck/traps/back/chest/belly and very thick thighs/glutes/forearms. Realistic human photograph or high-quality 3D scan, not cartoon, not exaggerated comic muscles or lean bodybuilder. Change pose to relaxed neutral A-pose: stand straight, feet shoulder-width apart toes forward, arms extended sideways and downward 45 degrees away from torso, straight relaxed arms, empty hands with all fingers naturally relaxed and separated, legs visibly separated. Calm closed-mouth face. Clothing: black strap singlet with black sleeveless tank on top, wide worn dark brown leather lifting belt with metal buckle, black knee sleeves with red stripes at top and bottom, black wrist wraps with red stripes, black calf-high socks, black flat lifting shoes. No logos. Full body entirely visible with small margins, centered. Portrait canvas EXACT 3:4 aspect ratio preferably 1152x1536. Head top at 5% canvas height and soles at 95%, fixed scale for subsequent turnarounds. Uniform solid #d9d9d9 background with absolutely no gradient, ground shadow, props or barbell. Uniform soft frontal studio lighting, clean texture baking reference with no dramatic or strong shadows. No text, watermark, logos. Single view only.
+
+## Front correction
+
+Edit this front modeling reference, preserve exact man identity, body shape, clothing, orthographic front camera and full-body A-pose. Corrections: knee sleeves must have RED HORIZONTAL BANDS at both TOP and BOTTOM edges, not vertical stripes; hands open with five relaxed distinctly separated fingers on each hand; background must be completely uniform flat #d9d9d9 including beneath shoes, no gradients or ground/contact shadows. Portrait 3:4. Leave 5% top/bottom margins, preserve head height and sole position for turnarounds. Shoes point straight forward, legs shoulder-width apart. Photorealistic natural anatomy. No text logos props.
+
+## Left
+
+Use case: identity-preserve. Edit provided view-front into a single different camera view for a Tripo3D character turnaround. EXACT SAME man, face, short curly dark hair, beard, tan skin, massive thick powerlifter physique with thick belly/thighs, exact black singlet and sleeveless tank, worn dark brown belt with buckle located only at FRONT, black knee sleeves red HORIZONTAL bands at upper/lower edges, black red-striped wrist wraps, calf black socks, black flat shoes. Preserve the SAME physical A-pose: straight upright body, legs shoulder-width apart, arms laterally abducted DOWN 45 degrees in the frontal plane, empty open hands naturally spread fingers. Rotate ONLY camera around vertical axis, do not change physical pose. Realistic scan/photo, soft uniform studio lighting. Uniform solid #d9d9d9 backdrop with NO gradient and NO floor/contact/cast shadow. Entire body centered with uncropped extremities. EXACT same portrait 3:4 canvas and scale as input: topmost hair at y=2.4% and shoe soles at y=95.1% of image, keeping same vertical coordinates for head/shoulders/belt/knees/soles. No text watermark logos props, no barbell. Strict orthographic LEFT anatomical side profile, camera sees his LEFT ear and LEFT body side, nose and all toes point to IMAGE RIGHT. In true side projection the laterally spread arms are foreshortened, hands at reference height around hips; do NOT swing arms forward or backward to fake a front-view A silhouette. Feet overlap in profile because they are separated laterally, not staggered.
+
+## Back
+
+Use case: identity-preserve. Edit provided view-front into a single different camera view for a Tripo3D character turnaround. EXACT SAME man, face, short curly dark hair, beard, tan skin, massive thick powerlifter physique with thick belly/thighs, exact black singlet and sleeveless tank, worn dark brown belt with buckle located only at FRONT, black knee sleeves red HORIZONTAL bands at upper/lower edges, black red-striped wrist wraps, calf black socks, black flat shoes. Preserve the SAME physical A-pose: straight upright body, legs shoulder-width apart, arms laterally abducted DOWN 45 degrees in the frontal plane, empty open hands naturally spread fingers. Rotate ONLY camera around vertical axis, do not change physical pose. Realistic scan/photo, soft uniform studio lighting. Uniform solid #d9d9d9 backdrop with NO gradient and NO floor/contact/cast shadow. Entire body centered with uncropped extremities. EXACT same portrait 3:4 canvas and scale as input: topmost hair at y=2.4% and shoe soles at y=95.1% of image, keeping same vertical coordinates for head/shoulders/belt/knees/soles. No text watermark logos props, no barbell. Strict orthographic REAR view, showing back of head, back of shirt, belt rear (NO buckle on rear), back of both legs/shoes. Preserve wide clear gaps between arms and body and between legs, exact same symmetrical A-pose and proportions as front.
+
+## Right
